@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@sessionId = demo

### First turn: destination, dates, guests and several filters at once
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "{{sessionId}}",
  "message": "Going to Haarlem 15-18 Aug 2027, travelling solo. I want a quiet, soundproofed room of at least 30 square meters with good in-room Wi-Fi. A communal lounge would be a bonus."
}

### Follow-up: update a range and add a filter
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "{{sessionId}}",
  "message": "Actually make it at least 40 square meters, and add parking"
}

### Follow-up: remove a filter
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "{{sessionId}}",
  "message": "never mind the communal lounge"
}

### Out of scope: state must stay untouched
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "{{sessionId}}",
  "message": "Who won the world cup in 1998?"
}

### Streaming turn (NDJSON: stage events, then the result)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "{{sessionId}}",
  "message": "add free breakfast"
}

### Read the current state
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/state?session_id={{sessionId}}

### Reset the session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/state/reset?session_id={{sessionId}}
